{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book","id":432301,"title":"If You Could Make a Demon Book","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-07T22:16:49-08:00","id":432301,"title":"If You Could Make a Demon Book","content":"They discussed this in the Werewolf forum a few weeks back, and a few month's before that was pitch season, but I thought we could reproduce it here. We have the Storyteller's guide coming up, the translation guide, and all the yummy goodness of the Dark Eras, but...<br /> <br /> If you could... if you had the chance to pick a new project for the Demon the Descent line, what would it be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T05:35:57-07:00","id":432551,"title":"","content":"A Tokyo book for Demon. After that? Well, I want to see what's in last book first before we get into details. There's lots of things that I'd like to see covered.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T13:26:37-07:00","id":433025,"title":"","content":"A Hunter/GMC/Demon crossover book about spytech and tradecraft in the World of Darkness and how to build a conspiracy when there are things all over who can trivially turn invisible and stalk you, read your mind, mind-control your agents, etc. <br /> <br /> A book for historical legends of the Unchained, sort of like the Red List for Vampire -- since we'll soon have Demons back in the Middle Ages, what've they been up to all this time? What secret boltholes and backdoors have they left in the system?<br /> <br /> I've had some buyer's remorse after backing Aztec Demon that I didn't put my expansion into Three Kingdoms China instead, with Demons working for Zhuge Liang and references to Sun Tzu's classification of spies, including &quot;doomed spies&quot; and &quot;surviving spies.&quot; So I would feel a lot better about it if they wrote a book about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4832-dannyk","name":"DannyK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T18:46:54-07:00","id":443521,"title":"","content":"I'd like an antagonist book in the vein of Night Horrors, with specific angels or demon-hunters or quisling demons players might encounter, a fat section on example Infrastructure and another on cults that you could plug and play into a variety of games. I really liked Splintered City, and the little write-ups we got in Interface, but some a nice group of out-there examples would be great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 03-15-2015, 09:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T23:40:37-07:00","id":443826,"title":"","content":"Interface Mark 2.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T00:06:24-07:00","id":443831,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DannyK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=433025#post433025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Hunter/GMC/Demon crossover book about spytech and tradecraft in the World of Darkness and how to build a conspiracy when there are things all over who can trivially turn invisible and stalk you, read your mind, mind-control your agents, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>This along with (since its a Hunter &amp; Demon book) a full writeup of the Deva Corporation as a Hunter Conspiracy with its unique Endowment tech.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T22:08:37-07:00","id":445368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=443831#post443831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> a full writeup of the Deva Corporation as a Hunter Conspiracy with its unique Endowment tech.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's mad genius level brilliant.<br /> <br /> You'd also include some <i>very unique</i> rules for morality, degeneration and The Code. Forget what the Vigil normally does to a person's sense of right and wrong; Deva Corporation employees have Form Gadgets that have been ripped out of captured demons, brain tissue implants donated from captured Fractals and that's to say nothing of the experimental Aether-enriched chemicals in the water cooler. By the time they hit the third or fourth degeneration their moral compass resembles something drawn by MC Escher on a mushroom samba bender and they're the Hunter equivalent of <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WUhOnX8qt3I\" target=\"_blank\">the Pyro</a>.<br /> <br /> You have the Hunter from Ashewood Abbey saying &quot;Dude. Dude. You are messed up and <i>need help</i>. Stay the fuck away from me&quot; <br /> <br /> Once we get that we could use something dealing extensively with with Cryptids and Sleepers, name it something catchy, say the Fortean Codex. So far we have only two sample sleepers. Give Demons a reason to hide. Have Sleepers in the workplace, in your school, your favorite restaurant. They're looking for you at every moment of every single day... and they don't know it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T21:23:13-07:00","id":447104,"title":"","content":"I keep thinking a Hunter conspiracy run by demon's... why not? so how about a book that takes an expanded look at Agencies. I'd also like to see them be bigger, not one to rule them all but multiple very large competing agencies that have at least a national if not international feel. CIA, MI6, KGB, etc...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T21:44:28-07:00","id":447123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=447104#post447104\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd also like to see [Agencies] be bigger, not one to rule them all but multiple very large competing agencies that have at least a national if not international feel. CIA, MI6, KGB, etc...</div> </div> </div> </div>Welcome to the humble Hell of Unchained association.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T22:04:11-07:00","id":447136,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=443831#post443831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This along with (since its a Hunter &amp; Demon book) a full writeup of the Deva Corporation as a Hunter Conspiracy with its unique Endowment tech.</div> </div> </div> </div>So it would like if TF:V and Cheiron decided to combine forces?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T00:17:42-07:00","id":447268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shock</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=447136#post447136\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So it would like if TF:V and Cheiron decided to combine forces?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It should be more distinct from that if it was done right.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T15:32:13-07:00","id":448371,"title":"","content":"A Night Horrors book that covers everything from weird cryptids to <i>qashmallim</i> to things without clear categories would be a lot of fun, especially if it threw some wordcount at Deva Corporation and how various international alphabet soup organizations interact with the techgnostic world. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T19:38:17-07:00","id":448663,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=447123#post447123\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Welcome to the humble Hell of Unchained association.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I don't get it","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T20:08:51-07:00","id":448723,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=448663#post448663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I don't get it</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">characterlimit</span><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DtD Core, p48, &quot;Hell for the Company&quot;</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Other demons are interested in relationships and social connection, but not with humans. Their Hell is establishing more formal and more trusting relationships between demons. These are the demons that work to strengthen the Agendas or even dream of creating some kind of global demonic society. They look at demons and see chaos; they want to bring order and organization.<br /> <br /> [\u2026]<br /> <br /> Demons who focus on other demons move from Agenda to Agenda and Agency to Agency, trying to help demons to overcome their paranoia and work together. So far, none of them have proposed anything like a shadow government for the Unchained, but that doesn\u2019t stop them from considering it.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T22:19:04-07:00","id":448833,"title":"","content":"don't know if I want to go that far... maybe... but I kind of like the idea of things like the Show &quot;The Americans&quot; something happens in DC affects things happening elsewhere, or vice versa. Local vibe but global implications. Obviously I can run my game this way, and if I were running demon, I would. The agency requests you attain cover from Bob as it is vital to operations in another city. The idea that you may never know why you did something or what it accomplished, and maybe it has very little local impact but could have a big impact elsewhere. But a shadow government? meh...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T22:32:33-07:00","id":448865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=448833#post448833\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">don't know if I want to go that far... maybe... but I kind of like the idea of things like the Show &quot;The Americans&quot; something happens in DC affects things happening elsewhere, or vice versa. Local vibe but global implications. Obviously I can run my game this way, and if I were running demon, I would. The agency requests you attain cover from Bob as it is vital to operations in another city. The idea that you may never know why you did something or what it accomplished, and maybe it has very little local impact but could have a big impact elsewhere. But a shadow government? meh...</div> </div> </div> </div>If all I was referring to was the &quot;shadow government&quot; bit, Terrace, I would not have quoted anything else. &quot;There are demons who aim to make Agencies More Of A Thing&quot; was the operative point of allusion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T05:31:12-07:00","id":449022,"title":"","content":"I'm actually less than enthused about Agencies. For all that they four &quot;kinds&quot; of agencies line up with the four agendas (tempters - temporal, integrators - compromised, saboteur - insurgent, inquisitors - free), in execution they're just really big rings. Its basically like having a tier 2 or 3 krewe.<br /> <br /> I could totally have seen doing an Agency book before the blurb in Flowers of Hell. Now, not as much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T06:37:27-07:00","id":449116,"title":"","content":"I'd like to see a general crossover book, with a chapter devoted to plot hooks, crossover-friendly crunch, and perhaps a character or two, for each other gameline. Possibly with rules and tips for Supernatural covers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T08:50:01-07:00","id":449317,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=449022#post449022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I could totally have seen doing an Agency book before the blurb in Flowers of Hell. Now, not as much.</div> </div> </div> </div>What blurb? I've skimmed flowers, but maybe I missed it<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=449022#post449022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm actually less than enthused about Agencies. For all that they four &quot;kinds&quot; of agencies line up with the four agendas (tempters - temporal, integrators - compromised, saboteur - insurgent, inquisitors - free), in execution they're just really big rings. Its basically like having a tier 2 or 3 krewe.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe I'm missing something but, a really big ring, yeah I mean that's all any organization is &quot;a really big group of individuals&quot;. So yeah I kind of think about what I'm looking for as a Tier 3 organization (heck maybe even a Tier 4, cosmic, we deal with time travel or etc).<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T08:57:51-07:00","id":449324,"title":"","content":"I would like to see a book about Cryptds, Stigmatics and other strange things touched by the God-Machine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4055-felipe","name":"Felipe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4055_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"538"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T09:03:03-07:00","id":449327,"title":"","content":"Definitely an endgame book for Demon, like Imperial Mysteries for mage.<br /> Seriously, I think all the splats deserve Tier 4 options, and seriously, like mage, the word demon could really work with the prefix 'arch'.<br /> It's also that the Demon book was really concentrated around lower-than-primum-5 in the stat and form designs.<br /> <br /> Also, (this is a lot more unlikely than it) an Innocent-Hunter-Demon(Heirs to hell) crossover book.<br /> I really love the fluff, and yes, Heirs to Hell is THE favorite supplicant for the WoD, up there with Asylum, Innocents, and Slashers.<br /> and really. How adorable/cute/cool/friggin awful would it be? Demon children and some children's compact?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1229-torete","name":"torete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"125"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T09:05:00-07:00","id":449329,"title":"","content":"&quot;Touched by the machine&quot; sounds like a great book <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T09:17:10-07:00","id":449361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>torete</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=449327#post449327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Definitely an endgame book for Demon, like Imperial Mysteries for mage.<br /> Seriously, I think all the splats deserve Tier 4 options, and seriously, like mage, the word demon could really work with the prefix 'arch'.<br /> It's also that the Demon book was really concentrated around lower-than-primum-5 in the stat and form designs.<br /> <br /> Also, (this is a lot more unlikely than it) an Innocent-Hunter-Demon(Heirs to hell) crossover book.<br /> I really love the fluff, and yes, Heirs to Hell is THE favorite supplicant for the WoD, up there with Asylum, Innocents, and Slashers.<br /> and really. How adorable/cute/cool/friggin awful would it be? Demon children and some children's compact?</div> </div> </div> </div>But what would Exploits for Level 6+ powers entail? They would destroy Cover altogether with a single use?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4055-felipe","name":"Felipe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4055_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"538"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T19:07:57-07:00","id":450020,"title":"","content":"\u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=449317#post449317\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What blurb? I've skimmed flowers, but maybe I missed it</div> </div> </div> </div> Flowers of Hell, page 80-89<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>torete</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=449327#post449327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Definitely an endgame book for Demon, like Imperial Mysteries for mage.<br /> Seriously, I think all the splats deserve Tier 4 options, and seriously, like mage, the word demon could really work with the prefix 'arch'.<br /> It's also that the Demon book was really concentrated around lower-than-primum-5 in the stat and form designs.</div> </div> </div> </div> Achieving hell is supposedly covered in the next book coming out, which may include said rules.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Felipe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=449361#post449361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But what would Exploits for Level 6+ powers entail? They would destroy Cover altogether with a single use?</div> </div> </div> </div> Level 6+ powers? Demons don't have powers that are ranked by levels. <br /> <br /> Remember, Game of Immortals (Changeling end game) didn't have powers that were ranked above 6+ either. Hints that disciplines will never break 6 either are common. Only mage does that. Instead, for the most part, achieving Gentry-hood, Archmage rank, Methsusalah status, etc seems to more imply shifting to a new kind of game that operates on different rules than the base game. <br /> Maybe we'll see how Demon Lords end up as mini-God-Machines and trying to beat off other Demon Lords. Or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T03:42:02-07:00","id":454019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=450020#post450020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200b Only mage does that.</div> </div> </div> </div>My single greatest pet peeve on nWoD.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1229-torete","name":"torete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"125"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T03:52:09-07:00","id":454026,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>torete</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=454019#post454019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> My single greatest pet peeve on nWoD.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well - many do have &quot;greater powers&quot; though. Going 6+ dots to represent it isn't a necessary thing. Werewolves have Milestone Gifts. Vampires have Elder-only Devotions. Mummies get access to the cosmic-devastation versions of their Utterances when their Sekhem is high enough.<br /> <br /> I agree something new for Changelings and Demons might be appropriate too. I don't think the others need anything though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T07:32:03-07:00","id":454360,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=454026#post454026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well - many do have &quot;greater powers&quot; though. Going 6+ dots to represent it isn't a necessary thing. Werewolves have Milestone Gifts. Vampires have Elder-only Devotions. Mummies get access to the cosmic-devastation versions of their Utterances when their Sekhem is high enough.<br /> <br /> I agree something new for Changelings and Demons might be appropriate too. I don't think the others need anything though.</div> </div> </div> </div> They HAD milestone gifts. I don't see their return in the new edition so far.<br /> <br /> <br /> In my opinion, I think that there's a notable difference between high level play with &quot;elder&quot; powers, and tier 4 games. In tier 4 vampire, that's a Primacy game, where personal powers are actually pretty meaningless. For changeling, the Game of Immortals can pretty much rewrite your reality at whim. Why would you need to buy powers when you effectively already have them using the new system?<br /> <br /> Tier 4 games are too wildly different from the other style of games that it makes the standard progression of abilities... almost meaningless. It only matters in an archmage game, because of the whole direct tie between knowledge and arcana ranking, and knowledge is everything in mage.<br /> <br /> Now, high powered games, with elders, alpha wolves, master mages, archdemons, and, uh, fae lords we'll say. Having selections of high level powers would be nice. But when it comes to tier 4 games, its not about the powers so much as a completely different mindset.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> For Demon, also, we have the issue that such high level powers already kinda exist. When one goes loud, you get every affinity Embed, and every Exploit. That's pretty nasty as it is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","user":"MCN","date":". 03-23-2015, 10:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T09:55:13-07:00","id":454514,"title":"","content":"It's not like milestone gifts went away with the 2nd Edition, any more than the old rites for Vampire disappeared with Blood and Smoke.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T10:49:59-07:00","id":454600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=454514#post454514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's not like milestone gifts went away with the 2nd Edition, any more than the old rites for Vampire disappeared with Blood and Smoke.</div> </div> </div> </div> Actually, that's kinda the point of a new edition, is it not? Reset the rules and setting from point zero? (And, yes, the old rites did disappear with Blood and Smoke, given that the new rules disallow many things that the old rites did; even the core book rites that got translated work differently, even with the same name and general abilities). I mean, if just assumed everything old carried over, we'd have Fighting Styles with multiple attacks, and that's something that they're avoiding in the new edition.<br /> <br /> You can translate things to the new edition, sure. But I wouldn't say they're included by default. Not unless its specifically included in the front section (Requiem 2 lists the Core book, the clan books, the Strix Chronicle Anthology, and Damnation City). I mean, look at the covenant books and the covenants in Blood and Smoke. They're totally different. I don't think its fair to assume that any old information made it in, be it fluff or mechanic.<br /> <br /> Now, I don't have Forsaken 2, and I was kinda assuming that the Tribe book wasn't included, but I could be wrong. Is there mention of the Milestone Gifts or that book in Forsaken?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","user":"MCN","date":". 03-23-2015, 01:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T10:58:51-07:00","id":454606,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=454600#post454600\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Actually, that's kinda the point of a new edition, is it not? Reset the rules and setting from point zero? (And, yes, the old rites did disappear with Blood and Smoke, given that the new rules disallow many things that the old rites did; even the core book rites that got translated work differently, even with the same name and general abilities). I mean, if just assumed everything old carried over, we'd have Fighting Styles with multiple attacks, and that's something that they're avoiding in the new edition.<br /> <br /> You can translate things to the new edition, sure. But I wouldn't say they're included by default. Not unless its specifically included in the front section (Requiem 2 lists the Core book, the clan books, the Strix Chronicle Anthology, and Damnation City). I mean, look at the covenant books and the covenants in Blood and Smoke. They're totally different. I don't think its fair to assume that any old information made it in, be it fluff or mechanic.<br /> <br /> Now, I don't have Forsaken 2, and I was kinda assuming that the Tribe book wasn't included, but I could be wrong. Is there mention of the Milestone Gifts or that book in Forsaken?</div> </div> </div> </div>The writers and devs have stated too many times that the new editions largely don't invalidate the old supplements for this to be true. Yes, choice things like the Unihar for Forsaken get removed, but for the most part second editions recompliate important ideas, attitudes, and mechanics and then sharpen them while making them work within Second Edition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T02:14:35-07:00","id":455554,"title":"","content":"Agreed with Arc (as usual) the new edition does update things, but by and large builds on an existing foundation.<br /> <br /> Frankly, I think this is a good thing. I'd just assume not have to worry about what books/ideas are &quot;Canon&quot; or not these days. Even if you like, say, the concept of Unihar, there is more than enough information to use them, and if you don't...don't. I mean, the books are toolbox to begin with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T09:48:01-07:00","id":455961,"title":"","content":"Can you call it agreeing when I'm just stating facts, I wonder?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-27T10:21:45-07:00","id":459128,"title":"","content":"I'd do night horrors. But like 50/50. Half the book would be things that hunt down demons but arrbt part of the God machine yet could work with the Angels. The other half would be things that intend on disrupting the gm and could be rivals or allied to demons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T22:26:26-07:00","id":494412,"title":"","content":"I can't speak for anyone else, but I find the story of the Pain Prophet more interesting than most of the &quot;modern&quot; god-machine material. I'd like more information on the Furies and the lost city brought down by humanity and all that stuff. Maybe expand the cosmology to include villains other than the God-Machine. Something akin to Earthbound from Fallen, maybe....very old, very insane Demons who's desire to be free of the God Machine endangers everything around them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-01T23:55:23-07:00","id":499923,"title":"","content":"I see the lost sunken city as a clear analogy to Atlantis in my own head-canon, itself seems to have a bit of a link when reading about the Mages mythology of it with the Blessed Isle from <i>Exalted</i>. I'd like some more info on the Furies myself also, I'm hoping they may pop up in some mention again (as Packet Theta currently held by the Deva Corporation is clearly named as the Fury named Death from the original fiction piece).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-02T00:43:57-07:00","id":499970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/432301-if-you-could-make-a-demon-book?p=499923#post499923\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see the lost sunken city as a clear analogy to Atlantis in my own head-canon, itself seems to have a bit of a link when reading about the Mages mythology of it with the Blessed Isle from <i>Exalted</i>. I'd like some more info on the Furies myself also, I'm hoping they may pop up in some mention again (as Packet Theta currently held by the Deva Corporation is clearly named as the Fury named Death from the original fiction piece).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> While they certainly play on the similar themes of some lost age/first city, I really don't see much similarity in the details.<br /> <br /> A city without death versus a city full of death mages<br /> <br /> A city of subjugated humans versus a city full of mages.<br /> <br /> And of course there's the fact that Atlantis was edited out of history like the loser in a wiki war.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-02T23:20:02-07:00","id":501427,"title":"","content":"I was thinking more of Atlantis supposed to be some 'blessed isle' and that there were dragons flying in it's skies. Brings to mind the Elemental Dragons, of which factor some into some Mage philosophy (I can stand to be corrected, I'm not a Mage player tbh). As for the editing out of Atlantis, I'd say Creation may have been what the Earth of the world of darkness was before the Celestial Ladder shattered and wrecked everything, pulling Supernal from the world and the Abyss come through. No more flat magical realm, now it's a round planet where magic is filtered.<br /> <br /> As always, this is just my own head-canon and a nice way to link things up. My main point was I agree I liked the Pain Prophet's story myself, it's part of why I've really gotten into the God-Machine stuff, to learn more about it all and I'd like to see a Fury or two appear in the future. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T20:47:34-07:00","id":502453,"title":"","content":"Actually apparently dragons teaching men how to do magic is not being included in second edition, from what I've heard. A pity.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}